WEBVTT

1
00:00:04,980 --> 00:00:06,540
Hold on for another ten days and a half

2
00:00:06,860 --> 00:00:08,060
There is hope for you to be rescued

3
00:00:11,060 --> 00:00:12,980
If no one comes, I won’t be able to hold on.

4
00:00:13,060 --> 00:00:16,210
What to do to die

5
00:00:16,650 --> 00:00:23,230
big sister

6
00:00:23,710 --> 00:00:24,830
There is an underground warehouse here

7
00:00:24,910 --> 00:00:27,150
Pictured is a lot of western medicine. I will take you in.

8
00:00:27,390 --> 00:00:29,350
But you have to take us away or not

9
00:00:29,990 --> 00:00:32,830
There are too many of you and you are too stupid to wait for rescue.

10
00:00:33,070 --> 00:00:34,510
If you can survive until then

11
00:00:34,750 --> 00:00:37,230
Can you help us sort out our losses? It's up to you.

12
00:00:37,590 --> 00:00:41,110
The most I can do is give you some survival swords. I won't help you to reinforce the door.

13
00:00:41,230 --> 00:00:43,510
Pile everything on top, don't take the dagger

14
00:00:43,790 --> 00:00:45,110
Don’t you have medical crutches?

15
00:00:45,310 --> 00:00:46,990
Hit them with heads if they lose their heads
